ci_lt.inp contains the magnetic transition dipole.
m_t_1.dat contains the time-dependent magnetic dipole.
m_mu_t_1.dat contains the time evolution of the scalar product between electric and magnetic dipoles.

sp_mol_mag_1.dat is the ECD specturm computed using make_spectra.x


First run WaveT and then make_spectra


Example with a delta pulse. Use Fmag='mag' in the input to turn off reading of ci_lt.inp, computing m(t) and ECD spectrum.
